=== Pass 1: PROBE + AUDIO GATE (silent fixture) ===

$ ffprobe -v error -select_streams a:0 -show_entries stream=codec_name,sample_rate,channels -of default=nw=1 silent-screen-recording.mp4
codec_name=aac
sample_rate=44100
channels=2

$ ffprobe -v error -show_entries stream=width,height,r_frame_rate,codec_name -select_streams v:0 -of default=nw=1 silent-screen-recording.mp4
codec_name=h264
width=2560
height=1600
r_frame_rate=30/1

$ ffmpeg -hide_banner -i silent-screen-recording.mp4 -af volumedetect -f null - 2>&1 | grep -E 'mean_volume|max_volume'
[Parsed_volumedetect_0 @ 0x8dec06700] mean_volume: -91.0 dB
[Parsed_volumedetect_0 @ 0x8dec06700] max_volume: -91.0 dB

GATE VERDICT: mean_volume < -40 dB (silent audio-only null source) — STOP per SKILL.md Pass 1.

=== Pass 1: PROBE + AUDIO GATE (voiced fixture) ===

$ ffmpeg -hide_banner -i voiced-screen-recording.mp4 -af volumedetect -f null - 2>&1 | grep -E 'mean_volume|max_volume'
[Parsed_volumedetect_0 @ 0xabac06700] mean_volume: -21.1 dB
[Parsed_volumedetect_0 @ 0xabac06700] max_volume: -17.7 dB

GATE VERDICT: mean_volume >= -40 dB — proceed to Pass 2.
